{"id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-literal.md","title":"Literal","display":"df-literal — Literal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-literal","aliases":["57-df-literal"],"display":"df-literal — Literal","depends_on":["[[57-df-atomic-formula]]","[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-literal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-literal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-literal — Literal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Literal-(Positive-and-Negative)\">Literal (Positive and Negative)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e38e198d11ebfafa\" href=\"?note=e38e198d11ebfafa\" title=\"57-df-atomic-formula\">57-df-atomic-formula</a>。命题化时将每个原子公式视为一个独立命题单位，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}\">\\(\\mathrm{PropVar}\\)</span> 是该载体的兼容名称。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\)</span>；否定构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\qquad\\mathrm{PropVar}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}_S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{AtFml}_S,\\qquad\\mathrm{PropVar}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}_S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\cup\\{\\neg P:P\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\coloneqq\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\cup\\{\\neg P:P\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}_S\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline P\\coloneqq\\neg P,\\quad\\overline{\\neg P}\\coloneqq P,\\quad\n\\mathrm{atom}(P)\\coloneqq P,\\quad\\mathrm{atom}(\\neg P)\\coloneqq P,\\quad\n\\mathrm{pol}(P)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\mathrm{pol}(\\neg P)\\coloneqq0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline P\\coloneqq\\neg P,\\quad\\overline{\\neg P}\\coloneqq P,\\quad\n\\mathrm{atom}(P)\\coloneqq P,\\quad\\mathrm{atom}(\\neg P)\\coloneqq P,\\quad\n\\mathrm{pol}(P)\\coloneqq1,\\quad\\mathrm{pol}(\\neg P)\\coloneqq0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补出原本未定义的命题单位集合与互补文字函数；互补负文字返回原子，不把双重否定语法对象误当成文字。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Literal-(Positive-and-Negative)","text":"Literal (Positive and Negative)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]